# Learning SPHinXsim

The simulation settings are provided in JSON format, 
which is a widely used data interchange format that is easy to read and write for humans and machines. 
The JSON files contain all the necessary information to set up and run simulations in SPHinXsim.

Choose simulation examples to learn SPHinXsim:

- [Dambreak](learning/dambreak.md)
- [Filling Tank](learning/filling-tank.md)
- [Milling](learning/milling.md)
